# save_viability_verdict/get_viability_verdict (verdict.go, issue #1578):
# FR12 append-only/never-UPDATE (byte-for-byte re-read of a prior version
# after a later save), version allocation under genuine concurrency
# (two simultaneous saves converge on versions 1 and 2, no lost write),
# idea_id-not-belonging-to-channel_id rejection, citation validation
# (same-Channel, exists) rejecting the whole write atomically, NFR2
# idempotency replay/conflict semantics, Creator+Analyst write /
# unassociated-Person-denied authz, FR13's current+full-history-in-one-call
